📉 Analytical Insights Dashboard
The final dashboard provides:

Descriptive Analysis: Female customers spend more; Middle Adults (29–44) are top spenders; Clothing dominates revenue.
Diagnostic Analysis: West region sales declined due to reduced discounts; Gold & Silver loyalty tiers underperform.
Predictive Analysis: Female spending in clothing & beauty will keep rising; West region sales will decline without discounts; Bronze customers show steady growth.
Prescriptive Analysis: Focus on female-driven categories, adjust discounts in West, improve loyalty perks for Gold & Silver tiers.
----------------------

✅ Conclusion
The business should:

Reinforce female-driven categories
Recalibrate regional discount strategies
Restructure loyalty programs to re-engage premium customers
Encourage Bronze customers to upgrade
